> 13. **Provenance ל-K2:** Bank dressing/bag_items v0.7 (DR-B1-01), KGR v0.6 (KG-002, KG-009, KG-011), INDEPENDENCE_TARGET v0.6 §5.1, FIRST_PLAN / PRE_DAY v0.5. provenance של LH לא משתנה.
